# netCDF field tags to fetch/compare for this case, one per line.
# A tag is the part of the output filename between "<run_id>_arpsfx_" and
# the trailing "_<daterange>.nc", e.g. for
#   NFR25_standard_namelist__v7_arpsfx_hour_zg_202001-202002.nc
# the tag is "hour_zg". Fetched from iox_keep/*/ under the run's directory.
#
# hour_wap (vertical velocity) is the more sensitive canary for pure
# executable/build reproducibility -- it's a diagnosed difference of larger
# terms, so it amplifies small floating-point drift. hour_zg (geopotential
# height) is smoother/larger-magnitude and more standard/interpretable, but
# a weaker early-warning signal. Comparing both.
hour_zg
hour_wap
